My students use it, again, Then we use it more as an optimization tool to make things go faster.

285
00:36:21,620 --> 00:36:30,320
But at the moment, just to really quickly, if you look around you right now in the world, every single thing you can see is made by a chemical reaction.

286
00:36:31,182 --> 00:36:32,960
And we need new chemical reactions.

287
00:36:33,480 --> 00:36:39,204
