00:39:19,960 --> 00:39:23,800
because it has seen similar things from the training data.

313
00:39:24,020 --> 00:39:36,220
So that might be a holy grail of AI for next breakthrough, I think in general AI tend to basically operate in between these two.

314
00:39:37,134 --> 00:39:45,440
I mean, it will basically try to generate things that are sounding familiar, or something that it kind of knows already.

315
00:39:45,440 --> 00:39:56,804
but if you give some enough, maybe prompting or guidance, it may be encouraged to generate something different.

