00:40:17,070 --> 00:40:28,516
So I think that could be the how you know, humans, human researchers, or humans in general, can interact AI to go beyond the current limitations.

319
00:40:29,966 --> 00:40:35,972
Hopefully in the future it'll become a bit more extrapolating and generate something more interesting.

