If we worried about my students getting a job, so I've actually kept asking our undergrad students, "You should actually double major, some part of science, be it chemistry or bio ,". because like, AI knowledge itself seems to be very close to be solved, or not many things that we can do.

335
00:42:43,140 --> 00:42:44,484
all those big companies are doing.

336
00:42:45,934 --> 00:42:48,340
So with that I think our time is almost over.

